  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Inside the sovereign immortal aperture, Fang Yuan’s dragonman clone has Dragon Palace produce dense smoke as the immortal killer move Dreamy Light Smoke. Wherever the smoke goes it engulfs what it meets; an immemorial year beast with rank eight battle strength cannot resist and vanishes into the smoke, then into the palace when the smoke returns.",
      "chapters": [
        1848
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "house_dragon_palace",
        "sys_killer_moves"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan had seen the smoke corrode phantom Heaven Overseeing Tower in a previous life and expected an offensive dream path move; using it himself, he finds it is for capturing enemies instead. Dragon Palace remains an enslavement path Immortal Gu House even with rank eight Dream Token among its cores, and Dreamy Light Smoke first traps a target so enslavement can follow. Among Dragon Palace’s dream path killer moves at that stage, he treats Dreamy Light Smoke as the most practical. In that period the Gu Immortal world and Heavenly Court still lack ways to deal with dream path methods.",
      "chapters": [
        1848
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_heaven_overseeing_tower",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "gu_dream_token",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Dragon Palace activates Dreamy Light Smoke; Jun Shen Guang and Vortex Space Boy fail to dodge and are carried away the moment they are struck.",
      "chapters": [
        1942
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "captures-in-heavenly-court",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_jun_shen_guang",
        "char_vortex_space_boy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Dragon Palace uses Dreamy Light Smoke again, Feng Jiu Ge’s song warrior throws itself into the smoke; the smoke then has no more offensive ability and returns like a python that has eaten its fill. Facing the dream path killer move, Duke Long does not dare to test it no matter how strong he is.",
      "chapters": [
        1951
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "limits-against-top-foes",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_feng_jiu_ge",
        "char_duke_long"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Spectral Soul stays vigilant toward Dragon Palace: once captured by Dreamy Light Smoke, he would be defeated at once.",
      "chapters": [
        2007
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
